{
  "nl": "全字段覆盖：输入框（备注是多行）、日期、时间、滑块、颜色选择器、穿梭框、级联、单选、多选、开关、评分、上传，以及一个下拉形式的状态列，用自定义渲染展示；支持增删改查。",
  "nlEn": "Full field-type coverage: input (remark is multiline), date, time, slider, color picker, transfer, cascader, radio, checkbox, switch, rate and upload, plus a status column backed by a select and displayed with a custom render; add, edit, delete and view are supported.",
  "fixedFields": ["remark", "status"],
  "pinnedDims": ["formtype:remark", "extPoints:status"],
  "nlStatedDims": ["propSet", "formtype:remark", "extPoints:status", "dataOptions:status", "formtype:status", "formtype:score"],
  "config": {
    "name": "AllTypes",
    "apiUrl": "/api/all-types",
    "fields": [
      {
        "prop": "name",
        "label": "名称",
        "formtype": "Input"
      },
      {
        "prop": "remark",
        "label": "备注",
        "formtype": "Input",
        "attrs": {
          "type": "textarea",
          "rows": 3
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "birthday",
        "label": "生日",
        "formtype": "DatePicker"
      },
      {
        "prop": "workTime",
        "label": "工作时间",
        "formtype": "TimePicker",
        "inQuery": false
      },
      {
        "prop": "progress",
        "label": "进度",
        "formtype": "Slider",
        "inQuery": false
      },
      {
        "prop": "themeColor",
        "label": "主题色",
        "formtype": "ColorPicker",
        "inQuery": false
      },
      {
        "prop": "tags",
        "label": "标签",
        "formtype": "Transfer",
        "inQuery": false
      },
      {
        "prop": "region",
        "label": "地区",
        "formtype": "Cascader",
        "inQuery": false
      },
      {
        "prop": "gender",
        "label": "性别",
        "formtype": "Radio",
        "dataOptions": [
          {
            "label": "男",
            "value": "male"
          },
          {
            "label": "女",
            "value": "female"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "hobbies",
        "label": "爱好",
        "formtype": "Checkbox",
        "inQuery": false,
        "dataOptions": [
          {
            "label": "读书",
            "value": "read"
          },
          {
            "label": "运动",
            "value": "sport"
          },
          {
            "label": "音乐",
            "value": "music"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "active",
        "label": "是否激活",
        "formtype": "Switch"
      },
      {
        "prop": "score",
        "label": "评分",
        "formtype": "Rate",
        "inQuery": false
      },
      {
        "prop": "avatar",
        "label": "头像",
        "formtype": "Upload",
        "inQuery": false
      },
      {
        "prop": "status",
        "label": "状态",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "inQuery": false,
        "dataOptions": [
          {
            "label": "初审",
            "value": "pending"
          },
          {
            "label": "复审",
            "value": "reviewing"
          },
          {
            "label": "通过",
            "value": "passed"
          },
          {
            "label": "拒绝",
            "value": "rejected"
          }
        ],
        "render": "(_, { row }) => h(ElTag, { type: row.status === 'passed' ? 'success' : row.status === 'rejected' ? 'danger' : 'warning' }, () => row.statusLabel)"
      }
    ],
    "actions": [
      "add",
      "edit",
      "delete",
      "view"
    ]
  },
  "notes": "all 13 VALID_FORM_TYPES plus textarea + render extension point. 2026-11-11（B 批 13）：gold 原把「复杂状态」单列成一个字段（prop complexStatus），NL 写「自定义 render 的复杂状态列」——「复杂」是修饰语还是标签的一部分不可判定，pred 写「状态」/`status` 是合理读法；而 gold 另有一个 label「状态」的 启用/禁用 下拉，按 label 身份对齐时两列争夺同一个 pred 字段。改法按方案：状态列并入那个下拉（label 定「状态」、prop 改 `status`、保留 render），NL 改为「一个下拉形式的状态列，用自定义渲染展示」并去掉独立的「下拉」项（同一个控件不数两次）。不放宽 extPoints —— 那会让「随便给某个字段挂 render」得分"
}
